  description_EN: Small cannonballs for massive destruction of enemy ships. However,
    they are not suitable for causing serious damage to structures.
  description_TR: "D\xFC\u015Fman gemilerine b\xFCy\xFCk \xE7apl\u0131 hasar vermek
